Summary of What Each File Does:
todo_screen.dart - Main screen showing tasks in 3 tabs with headers

add_edit_dialog.dart - Dialog for adding new tasks or editing existing ones

delete_dialog.dart - Confirmation dialog before deleting tasks

status_dialog.dart - Confirmation dialog before changing task status

search_screen.dart - Search functionality across all tasks

todo_model.dart - Data model defining what a Todo task is

db_helper.dart - Database operations (CRUD: Create, Read, Update, Delete)

main.dart - App entry point and theme configuration